<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Feb current account deficit $100 mln.</title>
<headline>Hungary Feb current account deficit $100 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's current account deficit widened by $198 million in February to an accumulated amount of $498 million, the National Bank of Hungary said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY CURRENT ACCOUNT (in million dollars)</p>
